aph","text":"生駒ちゃんとショッピングモール♪に行ったことと,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらと髪の毛 黒にしたと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いた記事を書いたんですが,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回もカテゴリー☆から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の名前選んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったんですが,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表示されていなかった様です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´・ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんなさい。,,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰の記事やねん!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな感じになってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/19/_l.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じです＾ω＾="},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/19/dsc_1084_ed.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-8464":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はママとお買い物してきたよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼購入品／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑毛糸とかレースとかいろいろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、パナマボーイで\nコーデュロイのロンスカ2着"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも裏原とかでかわいいお店\nいっぱい見てきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい雑貨屋さんと見つけちゃった\n楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか最近緑色がすきで、\n服を見ても何を見ても\n緑色に私の緑センサーが反応する"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緑の服が増えちゃうよーきゃー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スープカレー食べたあとに\nフローズンヨーグルト食べたっ\nさっぱりさわやかおいしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性じゃないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冷え性だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手足冷たくて辛い><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公園で一番好きな遊具は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャングルジム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今マンモスフリーマーケット\n行くか悩んでます\nいったほうがいいかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと盛り上がると思うので\n来てほしいなあ...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モード系とワイルド系\nどっちの服装が好きですか⁉"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モード系"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニスカートとロングスカート\nどっちが好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロング！でも、乃木坂の衣装\nみたいに中途半端な丈もすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めて握手した時の気持ちは\nどう思ったかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのとき、\n握手しにきてくれるって言うのが\n新鮮で、不思議な気持ちだった！\n終わったあと、すごい反省した。\n「あんな感じで良かったのかな？」\nって。ぎこちなかっただろうな..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、あの時思った気持ちは\n大切にしたいです。\n実は握手会する前にみんなで\n練習してたんだよー笑！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校で憧れの先輩とかいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学校も今も、\n部活とか入ってないから\n先輩と絡まないしいないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントおそくなっちゃうけど\nみてくれる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでます^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"修学旅行で京都奈良に来てるけど、\nまりかは修学旅行どこだった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も中学は京都奈良でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"団子潰し！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日も頑張りまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/16/1790611/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-7089":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"16人のプンシパル千秋楽！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うおお終わってしまった(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"総括は明日ゆっくり書きたいので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあ今日の報告！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/10/0619229/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"謎の角度。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ気にしないでね∩^ω^∩＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっとー\nあ結果から言うと、はいってない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、ずっと悩んでたのよ。\nPRとかPRとかPRとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、もう最後なんだし\nどーしよーとか言うのやめなよって\nあみ(能條愛未chan)に言われたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからもう悩むのやめた！\nおうたをうたいまーした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の最後に\nみなさんに歌を届けることできて\nほんとによかったです///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりひめたんは歌うの大好き(#^.^#)\nトークって緊張するんだけどね\n歌ってるときの自分は冷静なのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかった。\nそれに気づけたのがよかった。\nスカーってした＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラストはねねころ(伊藤寧々chan)とちま\n(樋口日奈chan)も登場しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでありがとうできて、\nほんまよかったね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーわけで完走！\n無事千秋楽迎えることができました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に 本当に本当に\nありがとうございました(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-21779":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは！\nけやき坂46の加藤史帆です☆\n☆皆さんにお知らせです☆\n本日3月9日(木)15:00〜3月10日(金)14:00まで、4thシングルの個別握手会第4次応募受付期間です！\nそして第4次応募受付からなんと！！またそれぞれの日程に1部ずつ追加していただくことになりました！皆さんのおかげです！本当にありがとうございます(´；ω；`)\nとっっっても嬉しいです初めての1日4部になって、とってもドキドキなんですが、皆さんとたくさんお話し出来ることが楽しみです♪\n是非会いに来て下さい！！！\n皆さんのことお待ちしています♪\nhttp://fortunemusic.jp/↑こちらからご応募できます∩^ω^∩宜しくお願いします！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHZ5SQ5JP7CPEA8732F8KX1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nびよん。\nおやすみなさい☆\n加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}